  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Beach_Caf%C3%A9?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219113615\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Beach café\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beach café\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Beach café</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Building</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>rep</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"rep\"><img alt=\"rep\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1c/Reputation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141647\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Rep. lvl(s) 13</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 71,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>beach café</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation</a> level 13 in the player's <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a>.\n</p><p>It is the last building to be unlocked in the town.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the beach café changes as the player upgrades it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Beach Café Stage 1.png (399 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fb/Beach_Caf%C3%A9_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713201418\" title=\"Beach Café Stage 1.png (399 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café Stage 1.png (399 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside_1.png\" title=\"Beach Café Inside 1.png (319 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/03/Beach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713201339\" title=\"Beach Café Inside 1.png (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café Inside 1.png (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Beach Café Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Beach_Caf%C3%A9_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713201432\" title=\"Beach Café Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside_2.png\" title=\"Beach Café Inside 2.png (330 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/db/Beach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713201356\" title=\"Beach Café Inside 2.png (330 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café Inside 2.png (330 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9.png\" title=\"Beach Café.png (6.74 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240219113615\" title=\"Beach Café.png (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café.png (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABeach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside.png\" title=\"Beach Café Inside.png (334 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/08/Beach_Caf%C3%A9_Inside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713200622\" title=\"Beach Café Inside.png (334 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café Inside.png (334 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>The beach café costs 71,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 2 days (or 99 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to build.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Serving</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>When the beach café is at level 1, it takes 2 hours (or 5 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to serve a customer and 7 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> are awarded.</li>\n<li>Serving time can be reduced to 1 hour and 12 minutes at most.</li>\n<li>Points can be increased to a maximum of 12 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> per customer.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The following materials are required to upgrade the beach café:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AHammer.png\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/81/Hammer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131656\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHand_Drill.png\" title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d4/Hand_Drill.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131624\" title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Hand drill\" height=\"175\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Hand drill\" height=\"175\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/hand-drill-13235\" title=\"Hand Drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hand drill</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATar_Bucket.png\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Tar_Bucket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131606\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Tar bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Tar bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tar bucket</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Orders</b></span></h3>\n<p>Customers visiting the beach café usually require:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Goods</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/fish-fillet-18999\" title=\"Fish Fillet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish fillets</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-tail-8470\" title=\"Lobster Tail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster tails</a>)</li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/hat-maker-18338\" title=\"Hat Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hat Maker</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/ice-cream-maker-3560\" title=\"Ice Cream Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ice Cream Maker</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/juice-press-3559\" title=\"Juice Press\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Juice Press</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/salad-bar-8900\" title=\"Salad Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Salad Bar</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/sandwich-bar-9403\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sandwich Bar</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/smoothie-mixer-11369\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smoothie Mixer</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/soup-kitchen-8444\" title=\"Soup Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Soup Kitchen</a></li>\n<li>products from the <a href=\"/wiki/sushi-bar-8892\" title=\"Sushi Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sushi Bar</a></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammers</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/cinema-13193\" title=\"Cinema\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cinema</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Shop</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/hand-drill-13235\" title=\"Hand Drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hand drills</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/bed-and-breakfast-13194\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bed and Breakfast</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/train-station-13239\" title=\"Train Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Train Station</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tar buckets</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Shop</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spa</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/train-station-13239\" title=\"Train Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Train Station</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=2024021911